      "id": "fcf98b8a-1a42-43b9-a78c-5392c8e994b4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Periodic Element Identifier\n\n## Current Topic Tackled\n\nThis project focuses on the topic of **Functions in Python**.\n\nThe program uses:\n- user-defined functions\n- function calling\n- parameters\n- conditional statements\n\nThe function is used to identify whether an element is classified as a metal, nonmetal, or metalloid, including its family or group in the periodic table.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "266ceff8-f168-4c17-97c6-427aae2de251",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Program Description\n\nThis program asks the user to enter a chemical element and identifies whether it belongs to metals, nonmetals, or metalloids, including its element family.\n\nI chose this topic because I’ve always been fascinated by how structured and systematic the periodic table looks while every element still behaves differently in its own way. As a Chemical Engineering student, chemistry naturally became one of the subjects I became emotionally attached to, especially because it feels like there’s always a hidden pattern behind everything.\n\nLately, I’ve also become interested in systems, classification, and how different things can still be connected despite their differences. I realized that the periodic table strangely reflects that idea. Every element has its own identity, properties, and behavior, but they still belong to a larger system.\n\nInstead of making a random beginner program, I wanted to create something that actually reflects my interests and something I personally find meaningful.",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "cf94470d-01ad-4684-95bf-ff5513997025",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "# Periodic Element Identifier\n# Created by: Kirsten\n\n# This program identifies whether an element\n# is a metal, nonmetal, or metalloid,\n# including its element family.\n\n# Function for classifying elements\n\ndef identify_element(element):\n\n    element_data = {\n        \"hydrogen\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Unique Nonmetal\"),\n        \"helium\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\"),\n        \"lithium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkali Metal\"),\n        \"beryllium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkaline Earth Metal\"),\n        \"boron\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Boron Group\"),\n        \"carbon\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Carbon Group\"),\n        \"nitrogen\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Pnictogen\"),\n        \"oxygen\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Chalcogen\"),\n        \"fluorine\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Halogen\"),\n        \"neon\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\"),\n        \"sodium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkali Metal\"),\n        \"magnesium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkaline Earth Metal\"),\n        \"aluminum\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"silicon\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Carbon Group\"),\n        \"phosphorus\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Pnictogen\"),\n        \"sulfur\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Chalcogen\"),\n        \"chlorine\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Halogen\"),\n        \"argon\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\"),\n        \"potassium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkali Metal\"),\n        \"calcium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkaline Earth Metal\"),\n        \"scandium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"titanium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"vanadium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"chromium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"manganese\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"iron\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"cobalt\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"nickel\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"copper\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"zinc\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"gallium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"germanium\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Carbon Group\"),\n        \"arsenic\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Pnictogen\"),\n        \"selenium\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Chalcogen\"),\n        \"bromine\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Halogen\"),\n        \"krypton\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\"),\n        \"rubidium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkali Metal\"),\n        \"strontium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkaline Earth Metal\"),\n        \"yttrium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"zirconium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"niobium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"molybdenum\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"technetium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"ruthenium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"rhodium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"palladium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"silver\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"cadmium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"indium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"tin\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"antimony\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Pnictogen\"),\n        \"tellurium\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Chalcogen\"),\n        \"iodine\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Halogen\"),\n        \"xenon\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\"),\n        \"cesium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkali Metal\"),\n        \"barium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkaline Earth Metal\"),\n        \"lanthanum\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"cerium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"praseodymium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"neodymium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"promethium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"samarium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"europium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"gadolinium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"terbium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"dysprosium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"holmium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"erbium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"thulium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"ytterbium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"lutetium\": (\"Metal\", \"Lanthanide\"),\n        \"hafnium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"tantalum\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"tungsten\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"rhenium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"osmium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"iridium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"platinum\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"gold\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"mercury\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"thallium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"lead\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"bismuth\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"polonium\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Chalcogen\"),\n        \"astatine\": (\"Metalloid\", \"Halogen\"),\n        \"radon\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\"),\n        \"francium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkali Metal\"),\n        \"radium\": (\"Metal\", \"Alkaline Earth Metal\"),\n        \"actinium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"thorium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"protactinium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"uranium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"neptunium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"plutonium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"americium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"curium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"berkelium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"californium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"einsteinium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"fermium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"mendelevium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"nobelium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"lawrencium\": (\"Metal\", \"Actinide\"),\n        \"rutherfordium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"dubnium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"seaborgium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"bohrium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"hassium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"meitnerium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"darmstadtium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"roentgenium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"copernicium\": (\"Metal\", \"Transition Metal\"),\n        \"nihonium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"flerovium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"moscovium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"livermorium\": (\"Metal\", \"Post-Transition Metal\"),\n        \"tennessine\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Halogen\"),\n        \"oganesson\": (\"Nonmetal\", \"Noble Gas\")\n    }\n\n    if element in element_data:\n        classification, family = element_data[element]\n\n        print(\"\\nElement:\", element.capitalize())\n        print(\"Classification:\", classification)\n        print(\"Family/Group:\", family)\n\n    else:\n        print(\"\\nElement not found.\")\n\n\n# Main Program\nprint(\"Periodic Element Identifier\")\n\nuser_element = input(\"Enter an element: \")\n\nuser_element = user_element.lower()\n\nidentify_element(user_element)",
