      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Documentation\n\nThe program includes:\n- User-defined functions\n- Function parameters\n- Function calling\n- Conditional statements\n- Dictionary data storage\n- User input handling\n- Comments for readability\n\nThese help make the program organized, readable, and beginner-friendly.",
